udDM5MzEzNjk4OQ==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/2582#issuecomment-393136989"},"message":"Turns out @joeyh pointed to the root of the issue. The machine in question had:\n\n```\n% cat /etc/security/limits.d/protect_headnode.conf\n*                hard    as            18000000\n```\nWith that removed, all works as expected. Something to watch out for with ghc, I guess.","files":null},{"type":4,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1527682119,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50MTY1MzM3NDAzMw=="},"status":2},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1536933639,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQyMTM2NzY5Nw==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/2583#issuecomment-421367697"},"message":"This is obsolete.","files":null},{"type":4,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1536933639,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50MTg0NjE4NjE0OA=="},"status":2}]}